   **Mitigation:**  
   ```solidity
   // Add events for critical state changes
   event FeesCollected(address indexed collector, uint256 amount);
   event DistributionMade(address indexed sender, address indexed recipient, uint256 amount);
   event TokenBurned(address indexed account, address indexed token, uint256 amount);

   // Emit events in relevant functions
